{"id":"33337cd2ed770cf0","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-logarithm.md","title":"Logarithm","display":"df-logarithm — Logarithm","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-logarithm","aliases":["58-df-logarithm","Logarithm"],"display":"df-logarithm — Logarithm","depends_on":["[[58-df-exponential]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-logarithm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-logarithm</span><span>Logarithm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logarithm — Logarithm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"58-df-exponential\">58-df-exponential</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z \\in \\mathbb{C} \\setminus \\{0\\}\">\\(z \\in \\mathbb{C} \\setminus \\{0\\}\\)</span> (non-zero complex number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w \\in \\mathbb{C}\">\\(w \\in \\mathbb{C}\\)</span> (complex number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\exp\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> (complex exponential, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"58-df-exponential\">58-df-exponential</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Log}(z)\">\\(\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\)</span> (exponential fiber defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\mathbb C\\setminus(-\\infty,0]\">\\(D=\\mathbb C\\setminus(-\\infty,0]\\)</span> (principal-branch domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}\\in\\mathbb C^D\">\\(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}\\in\\mathbb C^D\\)</span> (candidate principal branch)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultivaluedLog}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{MultivaluedLog}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithm} \\vdash\nz\\in\\mathbb C\\to\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:\\exp(w)=z\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithm} \\vdash\nz\\in\\mathbb C\\to\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:\\exp(w)=z\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}fiber} \\vdash\nz,w\\in\\mathbb C\\to\\bigl(w\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\leftrightarrow\\exp(w)=z\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}fiber} \\vdash\nz,w\\in\\mathbb C\\to\\bigl(w\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\leftrightarrow\\exp(w)=z\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivalued\\text{-}logarithm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MultivaluedLog}_S(z)\\leftrightarrow\nz\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists w_1,w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\;\\bigl(w_1\\neq w_2\\land w_1-w_2\\in2\\pi i\\mathbb Z\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivalued\\text{-}logarithm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MultivaluedLog}_S(z)\\leftrightarrow\nz\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists w_1,w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\;\\bigl(w_1\\neq w_2\\land w_1-w_2\\in2\\pi i\\mathbb Z\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}product} \\vdash\nz_1,z_2\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\nw_1\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_1)\\land w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_2)\n\\to w_1+w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_1z_2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}product} \\vdash\nz_1,z_2\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\nw_1\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_1)\\land w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_2)\n\\to w_1+w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_1z_2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}branch} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBranch}_S(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}},D)\\leftrightarrow\nD=\\mathbb C\\setminus(-\\infty,0]\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}},D,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\forall z\\in D\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exp(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}(z))=z\\land\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}(z)=a+ib\\land-\\pi&lt;b&lt;\\pi)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}branch} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBranch}_S(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}},D)\\leftrightarrow\nD=\\mathbb C\\setminus(-\\infty,0]\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}},D,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\forall z\\in D\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exp(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}(z))=z\\land\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}(z)=a+ib\\land-\\pi&lt;b&lt;\\pi)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Complex logarithm is defined without presupposing separate natural-logarithm or argument functions: it is the fiber of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\">\\(\\exp\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>It is multivalued because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(w+2\\pi ik)=\\exp(w)\">\\(\\exp(w+2\\pi ik)=\\exp(w)\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Branch cut: need to cut plane to define single-valued branch; principal branch <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C} \\setminus (-\\infty, 0]\">\\(\\mathbb{C} \\setminus (-\\infty, 0]\\)</span></li>\n<li>Analytic continuation: no single-valued holomorphic logarithm on any punctured neighborhood of 0</li>\n<li>Derivatives: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{d}{dz} \\log z = 1/z\">\\(\\frac{d}{dz} \\log z = 1/z\\)</span> on domain not containing 0</li>\n<li>Applications: Baker's theorem, logarithms of algebraic numbers, Dirichlet series</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahlfors, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Lang, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, Functions of One Complex Variable</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-exponential]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\exp\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}$ (complex exponential, see [[58-df-exponential]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"z \\in \\mathbb{C} \\setminus \\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"w \\in \\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Log}(z)","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\mathbb C\\setminus(-\\infty,0]","display":false},{"tex":"\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}\\in\\mathbb C^D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultivaluedLog}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalBranch}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logarithm} \\vdash\nz\\in\\mathbb C\\to\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\mathbb C:\\exp(w)=z\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}fiber} \\vdash\nz,w\\in\\mathbb C\\to\\bigl(w\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\leftrightarrow\\exp(w)=z\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multivalued\\text{-}logarithm} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MultivaluedLog}_S(z)\\leftrightarrow\nz\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\n\\exists w_1,w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z)\\;\\bigl(w_1\\neq w_2\\land w_1-w_2\\in2\\pi i\\mathbb Z\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}product} \\vdash\nz_1,z_2\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\nw_1\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_1)\\land w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_2)\n\\to w_1+w_2\\in\\operatorname{Log}(z_1z_2)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}logarithm\\text{-}branch} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrincipalBranch}_S(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}},D)\\leftrightarrow\nD=\\mathbb C\\setminus(-\\infty,0]\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}},D,\\mathbb C)\\land\n\\forall z\\in D\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exp(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}(z))=z\\land\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\log_{\\mathrm{pr}}(z)=a+ib\\land-\\pi<b<\\pi)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\exp","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp(w+2\\pi ik)=\\exp(w)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{C} \\setminus (-\\infty, 0]","display":false},{"tex":"\\frac{d}{dz} \\log z = 1/z","display":false}],"bytes":2574,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-798","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-logarithm.md|58-df-logarithm]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["689fa138a0ce2d6c","36d7463d215be751"]}